   194	## 3. Instances and facets (L2, L4)
   195	
   196	```lean
   197	structure Instance where
   198	  P       : ProtocolSpec
   199	  pparams : ProtocolParams      -- k, L, τ, q, Δ, …: fixed protocol identity
   200	  facets  : FacetBundle P       -- every exposed facet, once
   201	  hooks   : HooksSound P
   202	  deliv   : Deliverable P
   203	  iso     : RecordIsolated P
