# Async-resilient committees

The project asks whether one available protocol can combine committee sampling
with asynchrony resilience. Separate stabilization gadgets and two-layer
constructions are outside this question.

- `problem-statement.md` defines the question and candidate criteria.
- `model-weakenings.md` defines the explored assumptions.
- `paper-manifest.md` lists source literature.
- `../vrf-available-chain/` is an independent effort; do not integrate it
  without a request.

