   168	## 3. (S): conditional target and timeout safety — PROVED
   169	
   170	**Exact statement (S).** Under §1, let an honest nonempty height row at
   171	`a_r=d_s≥GST`, `s=rR`, use fresh fast source C from a synchronous label s.
   172	Let `t≥a_r`, and assume N2(C,s;a_r,t). Every honest HEAD emitted at a
   173	scheduled HEAD duty in `[q_s,t]` contains C. Every honest S that contains
   174	C immediately after d_s retains C through t. If `t≥d_(s+1)`, every
