   102	[fg-frame-recovery §2.3](fg-frame-recovery.md). The earlier paper proofs
   103	of the reset history are [fgsa-fast-opus §5.1](fgsa-fast-opus.md) and
   104	[fgsa-adjudicate §4](fgsa-adjudicate.md). This file reorganizes that
   105	material as a composition with explicit hypotheses. It adds the trunk
   106	lemma, the effective-filter count, the extension of the NJ record facts
