   130	
   131	The recovery environment (E-env) is: `a≤f`; full participation from GST;
   132	strict Δ delivery and accepted-object relay from GST; an awake honest
   133	proposer strictly after each trigger and within G; DC's multi-proposer
   134	recurrence Rec(g); every proof window in the horizon. Readers process
   135	receipts while asleep. A private faulty object has no relay deadline until
   136	an honest reader accepts it.
