  1011	  which precedes the frontier x+2. Neither bound dominates the other in
  1012	  general. λ_147 contains 2G, and βP contains G only through ρ. A scan of
  1013	  `R=3..20, k=2..59, g=3..20, G=1..39` (units of Δ) found 1644 of the
  1014	  parameter points with the uniform λ_147 bound above B_base, for
