   634	on a boundary are assigned to one adjacent attempt only.
   635	
   636	The count is allowed to depend on m. The sharper uniform treatment
   637	that charges only the one branch exclusion would require continuation
   638	of exact service through lower F advances. The present bound does not
   639	assume that treatment. It is sufficient for finite progress at each
   640	fixed m and supplies an explicit bound to the DC case split.
   641	
   642	**The causal cap used by the other job.** At an actual event-prefix cut
   643	with honest archival frontier M, each previously emitted honest height
   644	row has height at most M [DC6]. A crossing uses q_F distinct matching
   645	identities and hence an honest row. A carrier made only from pre-cut
