   441	least x+1. An old J at x is absent in the NJ prefix, or is F* in the
   442	finalized arm.
   443	
   444	For a crossing supported at or after r*, use the source body of its
   445	honest row. If that source preceded B's label, the honest supporter of
   446	B covered it by the induction. If it was at B's label, same-label
   447	compatibility applies. If it followed B's label, its honest supporter
