   511	### 5.1 A sufficient bound before the reset
   512	
   513	Fix a no-rise interval with honest archival frontier m. Within P its
   514	maximizing witnesses reach all freezes. At that frontier only a new
   515	J at m−1 can exclude the current path. It is unique under `a≤f`, so
   516	there is at most one such effective change. A lower J is inactive.
   517	A finalization below m−1 lies below every band witness. A finalization
   518	at m−1 is the same top-J event. This counts effective changes after
   519	relay, not alternating full and frozen duty tuples.
