   320	## 4. M1: what the trunk lemma proves, and what is still missing
   321	
   322	### 4.1 A proved extension of the source argument
   323	
   324	At fixed frontier m in F-mode, every accepted F has finalized height at
   325	most `m−2`. Otherwise its retained justification activates the top-J
   326	mode. Every band witness W of height at least `m−1` extends every such
   327	F, by DC's `finalized_preceq_of_height_lt`.
