   336	Now consider a raw genuine prefix B at a synchronous label inside an
   337	effective N1 interval. It has an honest supporter A. The actual honest
   338	HEAD A has height at least `m−1`: below that height a witness path has
   339	an eligible child, so the finite walk cannot stop there. Relay puts A
   340	and its path in the next required views.
