   109	```text
   110	┌───────────────┬──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
   111	│ Current regime│ Prefix-closure status                                                    │
   112	├───────────────┼──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
   113	│ Sleepy        │ Yes, for complete time prefixes with a nonnegative horizon. Preserve E   │
   114	│               │ and assignments; retain all events at the cutoff time.                   │
   115	│ StableSleepy  │ Yes, on the same basis. Keep the same awake history used by η.            │
   116	│ Fast          │ Yes, on the same basis. Full participation restricts to the prefix.       │
   117	│ Outage        │ No for arbitrary cuts: b₁ ≤ horizon is required. Yes for cuts ≥ b₁.       │
   118	│ FastOutage    │ Same restriction as Outage.                                              │
   119	│ Recovery      │ No for arbitrary cuts: GST + ρ ≤ horizon is required. Yes above that      │
   120	│               │ bound; recurrence only tests completed windows.                          │
   121	│ StrongArmed   │ No for arbitrary cuts: b₀ ≤ horizon is required. Yes for cuts ≥ b₀.       │
   122	└───────────────┴──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
